    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Spacious 4 Bedroom Detached Residence on Circa 0.45 Acres\r\n\r\nJohn Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates are delighted to bring this impressive four-bedroom detached residence to the market, situated in Castlematrix, Rathkeale, Co. Limerick.\r\n\r\nSet on circa 0.45 acres, this substantial detached residence offers spacious and well-proportioned accommodation throughout, together with mature gardens, an attached garage, outside storage shed and separate boiler room.\r\n\r\nSet in a private and mature setting, the property offers a wonderful sense of privacy while remaining conveniently close to Rathkeale town and its range of amenities.\r\n\r\nThe property is approached through an attractive front garden with mature shrubs and lawned areas, creating an appealing setting for this fine residence.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, spacious sitting room and separate drawing room, both of which feature fireplaces. The kitchen includes tiled flooring and is complemented by a separate dining room, utility room and downstairs shower room with WC.\r\n\r\nA bright sunroom overlooks the rear garden, providing an ideal space to relax and enjoy views of the surrounding grounds.\r\n\r\nAn attached garage provides excellent additional storage and potential for a variety of uses.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property offers four bedrooms, including a spacious master bedroom with ensuite, together with a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nAccommodation Comprises:\r\n\r\nGround Floor:\r\nEntrance Hallway: 11.87 ft x 12.03 ft\r\nSitting Room: 25.09 ft x 12.91 ft – Feature fireplace\r\nDrawing Room: 14.71 ft x 13.66 ft – Feature fireplace\r\nKitchen: 13.56 ft x 9.92 ft – Tiled flooring\r\nDining Room: 11.88 ft x 9.92 ft\r\nSunroom: 10.53 ft x 13 ft – Overlooking the rear garden\r\nUtility Room: 8.87 ft x 7.41 ft\r\nDownstairs Shower Room: 8.16 ft x 7.53 ft – WC and shower\r\nAttached Garage: 17.05 ft x 16.81 ft\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\nMaster Bedroom: 13.59 ft x 14.45 ft\r\nMaster Ensuite: 200.12 sq. ft.\r\nBedroom 2: 12.89 ft x 11.77 ft\r\nBedroom 3: 10.95 ft x 10.35 ft\r\nFamily Bathroom: 8.08 ft x 6.61 ft\r\nOutside\r\n\r\nThe property sits on a generous site extending to circa 0.45 acres and benefits from mature gardens to the front and rear. Additional outside storage is provided by a storage shed and boiler room.\r\n\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a substantial detached property offering generous accommodation, mature grounds and excellent potential.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with John Giltinane Auctioneer & Associates."
      }
